  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.07 “Pro forma adjustment” means an adjustment in the test year to arrive at an adjusted test year appropriate for a forecasted period.\n\nSource. #8428, eff 9-10-05 (from Puc 1601.06); ss by #10535, eff 3-4-14 (from Puc 1602.06); ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 1602.03)",
